              <tr><td>Mid Mar – Early Nov (Summer)</td><td>EDT</td><td>UTC−4</td><td>4 hours</td></tr>
              <tr><td>DST Transition (Spring)</td><td>EST → EDT</td><td>Clocks spring forward 1 hour</td><td>Changes from 5 to 4</td></tr>
